flowchart LR
  subgraph INGEST[Ingestion]
    D[12 synthetic Markdown circulars] --> C[Chunking and spans]
    G[schools.gpkg: 1062 school polygons] --> F[GeoJSON features and locations]
    SYN[Synthetic roads and land-use geometries] --> F
    C --> EX[Rules plus local LLM extractor]
    F --> EX
    EX --> EN[Entity resolution]
    C --> EM[Local E5 or MiniLM embeddings]
    EN --> GR[Relations and bounded graph]
    EM --> CI[(Elasticsearch east_india_chunks)]
    EN --> EI[(Elasticsearch east_india_entities)]
    GR --> RI[(Elasticsearch east_india_relations)]
  end
  subgraph QUERY[Retrieval]
    Q[Question] --> QE[Entity detection]
    Q --> KW[BM25]
    Q --> KN[kNN vector]
    QE --> GE[Graph expansion up to 2 hops]
    KW --> RRF[Hybrid RRF]
    KN --> RRF
    GE --> RRF
    RRF --> CE[Local cross-encoder reranker]
    CE --> CAL[Fit-only confidence and abstention]
    CAL --> LLM[Local Qwen 1.5B generation]
    LLM --> A[Validated JSON answer and citations]
  end
  CI --> KW
  CI --> KN
  RI --> GE
  EI --> QE
  subgraph LOCAL[Local services, loopback only]
    ES[Elasticsearch 8.19 :9200; rag_app, three scoped indices]
    GS[GeoServer 2.27 :8080; rag_geo and three WFS layers]
    MODEL[llama.cpp :8081; Qwen2.5 1.5B Q4_K_M]
  end
  ES -. live verified .-> CI
  GS -. authenticated WFS; non-school layers synthetic .-> F
  MODEL -. live endpoint; extraction quality limited .-> LLM
